WEBVTT

00:00:26.814 --> 00:00:30.610
I was born just a few days
before the Chernobyl disaster

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:33.488
and a few years before the collapse
of the Soviet Union.

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:36.866
I grew up in an independent Ukraine,

00:00:36.908 --> 00:00:40.203
struggling to overcome the legacy
of the Soviet system.

00:00:40.995 --> 00:00:44.415
My mother and my grandmother
worked very hard

00:00:44.457 --> 00:00:47.460
so that I could have a good education

00:00:47.502 --> 00:00:51.255
because they believed
my generation would build the country.

00:00:51.923 --> 00:00:53.174
And we have.

00:00:53.674 --> 00:00:56.010
Until six weeks ago,

00:00:56.052 --> 00:00:58.763
Ukraine was on an upward path,

00:00:58.763 --> 00:01:02.391
becoming more prosperous,
more fair, more free.